  "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/2192_new-friend-2.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Today I met a new friend at work. He’s Chinese. In the evening, he took me to a Chinese restaurant. It was my first time eating Chinese food, and I thought it was delicious. I really liked it. He said he could teach me to cook Chinese food this weekend, which made me very happy. He’s a great friend, but his English isn’t very good. I think I can learn Chinese so we can talk more."
  ],
  "english_full": "Today I met a new friend at work. He’s Chinese. In the evening, he took me to a Chinese restaurant. It was my first time eating Chinese food, and I thought it was delicious. I really liked it. He said he could teach me to cook Chinese food this weekend, which made me very happy. He’s a great friend, but his English isn’t very good. I think I can learn Chinese so we can talk more.",
  "japanese_paragraphs": [
    "きょう、私は職場で新しい友達に出会いました。彼は中国人です。夕方、彼は私を中国料理のレストランに連れて行ってくれました。私が中国料理を食べるのは初めてで、それがとてもおいしいと思いました。私は本当にそれが好きでした。彼は今週末に中国料理の料理を教えてくれると言いました。それが私をとても幸せにしました。彼は素晴らしい友達ですが、彼の英語はあまり上手ではありません。私は中国語を学べると思いますので、もっと話せるようになるでしょう。"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    ""
  ],
